WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.100
Deleted by mistake.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.400
No recycle bin for a single work item.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.600
Restorable lists what was deleted.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.900
One click to restore.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.300
Old comments come back quoted.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:12.950
Attached files are listed, not restored.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.000
Restorable. Restore Deleted Work Items for Jira. By Clearwren. Coming soon to the Atlassian Marketplace.
